---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';
import Schema from '../../components/Schema.astro';

const title = 'Serving 40 Countries - HouseTech Group News';
const description = 'HouseTech Group serves 40 countries across 6 continents with 8-year international expansion from 2015 Southeast Asia entry to 2023 global milestone.';

const articleSchema = {
  headline: 'HouseTech Serves 40 Countries Across 6 Continents with OEM Kitchen Appliances',
  description: 'HouseTech reaches 40-country milestone across 6 continents with 8-year international expansion starting from Southeast Asia in 2015.',
  image: 'https://www.housetech-ch.com/logo-housetech.png',
  datePublished: '2023-01-15',
  author: { name: 'HouseTech Group' },
  publisher: {
    name: 'HouseTech Group',
    logo: { url: 'https://www.housetech-ch.com/logo-housetech.png' }
  }
};

const faqItems = [
  {
    question: 'How many countries does HouseTech serve globally?',
    answer: 'HouseTech serves customers and partners in 40 countries worldwide.'
  },
  {
    question: 'Across how many continents does HouseTech operate?',
    answer: 'HouseTech operates across 6 inhabited continents globally.'
  },
  {
    question: 'When did HouseTech begin international expansion?',
    answer: 'International expansion began in 2015 with Southeast Asian markets.'
  },
  {
    question: 'When did HouseTech enter the European market?',
    answer: 'European market entry occurred in 2017 through Germany and France.'
  },
  {
    question: 'When did HouseTech enter North American market?',
    answer: 'North American market entry completed in 2019 with certification.'
  },
  {
    question: 'Which region represents next expansion frontier?',
    answer: 'African markets represent the next major frontier for expansion.'
  }
];
---

<Layout title={title} description={description}>
  <Schema type="article" data={articleSchema} />
  <Schema type="faq" data={{ items: faqItems }} />
  <Header activeNav="news" />
  
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <nav class="breadcrumb">
        <a href="/">Home</a> / <a href="/news">News</a> / <span>Company</span>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="content-section">
    <div class="container">
      <article class="content-area" style="max-width: 850px;">
        
        <header class="article-header">
          <span class="article-category">Company</span>
          <h1 class="article-title">Serving 40 Countries: HouseTech's Global Journey in Kitchen Appliances</h1>
          <div class="article-meta-info">
            <span>📅 January 2023</span>
            <span>🏷️ Company</span>
            <span>⏱️ 6 min read</span>
          </div>
        </header>

        <figure class="article-image-figure">
          <div style="width:100%;aspect-ratio:16/9;background:linear-gradient(135deg, #0891b2, #0e7490);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border-radius:var(--radius-lg);">
            <svg width="120" height="120" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="rgba(255,255,255,0.3)" stroke-width="1">
              <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/>
              <path d="M2 12h20M12 2a15.3 15.3 0 014 10 15.3 15.3 0 01-4 10 15.3 15.3 0 01-4-10 15.3 15.3 0 014-10z"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <figcaption class="article-image-caption">HouseTech Global Presence</figcaption>
        </figure>

        <div class="article-body">
          <p>HouseTech celebrates 40-country milestone across 6 continents in January 2023. 8-year international expansion transforms domestic Chinese manufacturer into globally recognized OEM kitchen appliance partner.</p>
          
          <p>From small Shenzhen workshop in 2012 to sophisticated ISO-certified manufacturing enterprise. Advanced R&D and established distribution networks span Europe, Asia, and the Americas.</p>
          
          <h2>Geographic Expansion Timeline</h2>
          
          <p>2015 first export orders to Southeast Asian markets establish initial international presence. 2017 European market entry through distributor partnerships in Germany and France.</p>
          
          <p>2019 North American certification and market entry completes all major market coverage. 2021 South American market development completes global geographic reach.</p>
          
          <p>2023 reaches 40-country milestone representing customers on every inhabited continent. Strategic progression builds market expertise region by region over 8 years.</p>
          
          <h2>Market-Specific Approaches</h2>
          
          <p>European markets demand premium quality, energy efficiency, and sophisticated design aesthetics. North American partners prioritize safety certification, competitive pricing, and reliable supply chains.</p>
          
          <p>Asian markets often require customized features and flexible order quantities. Local teams adapt products and services to meet regional preferences and regulatory requirements.</p>
          
          <h2>Looking Forward</h2>
          
          <p>40-country presence serves as foundation for continued growth. Significant opportunities identified in emerging markets with low kitchen appliance penetration rates.</p>
          
          <p>African markets represent next frontier for strategic expansion. HouseTech prepares with market research and partner development initiatives across the continent.</p>
          
          <p>40-country milestone reached across 6 continents over 8-year strategic international expansion from 2015 to 2023.</p>
        </div>
        <div style="background:linear-gradient(135deg, var(--color-primary), #1a4a7a);border-radius:var(--radius-lg);padding:var(--spacing-xl);margin:var(--spacing-xl) 0;text-align:center;color:white;">
          <h3 style="font-size:var(--font-size-xl);margin-bottom:var(--spacing-sm);color:white;">Ready to Develop Your Custom Product Line?</h3>
          <p style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.85);margin-bottom:var(--spacing-lg);max-width:600px;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;">HouseTech provides end-to-end OEM/ODM services — from concept design to mass production. Get factory-direct pricing with full certification support.</p>
          <div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:var(--spacing-sm);justify-content:center;">
            <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-primary" style="text-decoration:none;">Get OEM Quote →</a>
            <a href="/download" class="btn btn-outline-white" style="text-decoration:none;">Download Catalog</a>
            <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-outline-white" style="text-decoration:none;">Request Sample</a>
          </div>
        </div>


        
        <div style="background:var(--color-bg-elevated);border:2px solid var(--color-accent);border-radius:var(--radius-lg);padding:var(--spacing-xl);margin:var(--spacing-xl) 0;text-align:center;">
          <h3 style="font-size:var(--font-size-lg);margin-bottom:var(--spacing-sm);color:var(--color-primary);">Partner with HouseTech for Your Next Product Launch</h3>
          <p style="color:var(--color-text-light);margin-bottom:var(--spacing-lg);max-width:600px;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;">15+ years of manufacturing excellence. 500+ employees. 30,000m² facility. Serving 50+ countries. Let's build your brand together.</p>
          <div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:var(--spacing-sm);justify-content:center;">
            <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-primary" style="text-decoration:none;">Contact Sales →</a>
            <a href="/download" class="btn btn-accent-outline" style="text-decoration:none;">Download Catalog</a>
            <a href="/service" class="btn btn-accent-outline" style="text-decoration:none;">View OEM Services</a>
          </div>
        </div>
<nav class="article-nav">
          <a href="/news/energy-efficient-eu-aplusplus" class="article-nav-link">
            <span class="article-nav-label">← Previous</span>
            <span class="article-nav-title">Energy Efficient Products</span>
          </a>
          <a href="/news/german-brand-oem-success" class="article-nav-link" style="margin-left:auto;text-align:right;">
            <span class="article-nav-label">Next →</span>
            <span class="article-nav-title">German OEM Success Story</span>
          </a>
        </nav>

        <div style="text-align:center;margin-top:var(--spacing-xl);">
          <a href="/news" class="btn btn-accent-outline">← Back to All News</a>
        </div>

      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <Footer />
</Layout>
